  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If the tracking type is change by turning on/off tracker and it happen that pose space is enable. A 6 PT user won't be able to set it to default.\nThe user default high will be offset from the floor.\nCurrently pose space cannot be use by 6 PT user.\nUsually opening the quick menu will force reload the avatar but only if the tracking change from 3+/4-.\nWhen opening the quick menu:\n3-4 = reload\n3-6 = reload\n4-6 = no reload\n6-4 = no reload\n6-3 = reload\nIn a scenario the avatar is not reload, the pose space cannot be set to default in 6 PT",
